WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:08.950 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  have you ever heard of dragonflies that  snipe their prey with bolts of energy or  octopuses that serve as guard dogs or  necromancer bees that live in reanimated  carcass hives these images aren't pulled  from some bizarre medieval manuscript  nor are they long-lost renaissance  paintings  these are from the codex and versus a  modern world-building project from the  imagination of the brilliant artist and  writer luca vanzela brought to life  through collages of classical art the  world of codex and vs is full of flora  and fauna that have evolved to use  magical energy visitors from parallel  dimensions and fractures in space and  time at a glance the surreal scrambled  visuals are difficult to make sense of  yet like a medieval bestiary the project  does follow a unique system of internal  logic  so for this entry into the archive i'll  investigate the creatures people and  locations of this scrambled world and  reveal the hidden order to the chaos of  codex and vs  the land of codex inversus exists in the  wake of a cosmic upheaval known as the  collapse where extra-dimensional realms  crashed into the material world  releasing vast magical energies that  altered reality  understanding the realm as it exists  today is no easy task for the world is  full of strange oddities  yet we must start somewhere in the  center of the northernmost continent  lies the valley of delights a relatively  safe and idyllic region where magic  practitioners create surreal sights but  it's not just people casting the magic  in codex and vs even small creatures  like the bizarre transmuter snail have  evolved to use simple spells  in their neutral form a transmuter snail  is indistinguishable from an ordinary  snail yet if say a plant is out of reach  a transmuter snail will move their eye  stalks in specific patterns to rapidly  change their body gaining frog like legs  for jumping if trying to cross a puddle  a transmuter snail might adopt a  swimming form gaining a tail similar to  a tadpole's and when trying to carry an  object these snails might even gain a  long prehensile appendage equivalent to  an octopus tentacle  the first human spellcasters called the  evokers learned how to wield magic by  studying animals like the transmuter  snail these early wizards found that  existence can be shifted with the right  pattern and that pulling on the threads  of reality can be dangerous for spells  in codex and versus are strange and  unpredictable often altering the user's  physical body beyond recognition and in  the valley of delight some spellcasters  have also begun altering the biology of  animals the chimera cat is the result of  artificial speciation through  transmutation magic with a spring-like  body and piercing tail chimer cats are  designed to be the ultimate form of pest  control  for while the valley is an idyllic  locale it has a bit of a rat problem  manticorats are winged rodents that  never evolved to cast spells themselves  but are quite adept at sniffing out  magical ingredients on which to feed and  while the chimera cats proved effective  at catching the manticorats now the  valley is overrun with chimera cats  instead  in codex and vs human attempts to  rewrite existence often end with  disaster yet following the collapse of  other realms into the material world  humans now share territory with wiser  formerly mythic beings  north of the valley of delights the  long-lived elves build their eternal  kingdoms elves possess a greater  understanding of how to safely cast  spells than humans and specialize in  controlling the elements  in the mountains of the south  subterranean dwarves are more practical  in their reality manipulation creating  artificial beings to aid in their mining  and there's another tunneling life form  native to the southern continent  abduring termites are capable of  incredible feats of engineering they  have evolved to cast spells not with  their bodies but with the shape of their  tunnels through the digging of complex  patterns abjuring termite nests are  protected by a low level spell and are  virtually indestructible termite farms  have become novelty items with some  individuals putting them on display and  asking guests to try and smash them  which is physically impossible  yet the termites still have predators  the mudpecker is a bird that uses  stealth to catch termites inserting  their thin beaks into the nest's pores  without causing immediate alarm and  slurping clean one or two tunnels before  the defenses are alerted it's a strategy  similar to ordinary woodpeckers and  suggests that sometimes the best path is  the one of least resistance  in the southernmost region of the world  perhaps the strangest life forms of all  are the matras  sentient constructs of unknown origin  these clockwork beings strive to replace  chaotic biological life with precise and  reliable artificial creatures most  notably the mantras oversee the enigma  library a collection of texts no one is  able to translate the artificial  cube-headed curators of this library  search for a grand diagram a complete  and comprehensive explanation of how the  claps warped creation so far they have  found nothing  the primordial chaos of the collapse has  changed some populations in incredible  ways the seafaring halflings possess  bodies that defy perspective like living  optical illusions they seem to have  pieces missing from certain angles these  unsettling gaps which are common on  hands and arms cause no pain and are the  result of parts of their bodies phasing  through dimensional reality  and as is often the case in codex and  versus certain animals have evolved to  take advantage of similar magical  phenomena conjuring ants are tiny  insects with an impressive secret  like ordinary ants conjuring ant society  is mainly preoccupied with transporting  food back to the nest for later  consumption  but conjuring ants have found a faster  method than carrying the food themselves  by moving in a specific pattern around a  piece of vegetation conjuring ants can  fold space-time and teleport food  directly back to the nest  to the north reality becomes even  further warped here a marine paradise  co-exists with a prairie  known as the ethereal ocean this  environment is possible due to  out-of-phase water in the sky that  various fish swim through all animals  here can interact with each other even  if they respond to different  environmental conditions small fishes  graze the fur of horses sharks hunt  flocks of birds and spiders weave webs  to catch flying shrimp  in this vast region where the sky  behaves like the sea certain groups of  wizards have domesticated octopuses  which fill a similar role to dogs or  cats  some breeds of octopuses are able to  hunt for vermin and scare off intruders  while others are clever enough to fetch  tools and alchemical ingredients some  magi octopuses can even cast small  spells although they are too shy to do  so in public  the ethereal ocean is part of a kingdom  called the angelic unison ruled by the  ethereal descendants of celestial beings  the land is a place where anything can  happen  a realm of infinite wonders at the heart  of the angelic unison are grassy plains  populated by cosmic animals stargazing  cows are inherently magical creatures  that produce milk with calming and  relaxing properties the restless  insomniac sheep are the cow's opposite  with their milk acting as a natural  stimulant making sheep's butter a  popular breakfast food across the  kingdom  yet the most important animals in the  angelic unison are the holy cows  descendants of extra-dimensional animals  from before the claps that interbred  with their earthly counterparts holy  cows possess the ability to quell  aggression just by looking at someone  their halo horn signifies their  importance and their milk always tastes  sweet even when spoiled which can  actually be problematic and can cause  sickness if one isn't careful  the angelic unison is a kingdom where  almost all things possess some level of  extra dimensional distortion even stones  take on fantastical properties in the  floating plains a region famed for its  slabs of levitating rock while an  interesting novelty these boulders can  also be something of a nuisance  disrupting herds and keeping rain from  watering crops  on the western edge of the continent the  independent nation of beasts has formed  here many groups of humanoids with  animal features gather together under  one banner and cast unique spells  in crowded cities the cat folk are  common sight filling the knights with  the sounds of their serenades  unfortunately for the general populace  to be a good singer or just in tune is  not a prerequisite catfolk are also  excellent weavers and spellcasters  animal folk in general have a unique  attitude towards magic seeing the  energies of the dimensional field is  conscious and spells a way of asking the  field for assistance rather than  controlling it  snake folk are another common resident  in cities preferring to stay indoors due  to their cold-blooded physiology their  ancestral fangs make chewing difficult  and so they have a unique culinary  tradition based around soft foods snake  folk cuisine has become famous across  the continent and many serpents now run  popular taverns  shambling in the back alleys of beast  cities are unnerving pests the bodies of  deceased animals have been spotted  moving seemingly of their own accord  surrounded by buzzing insects these  corpses are in fact the mobile hives of  necromancer bees these bizarre insects  have come up with an ingenious way of  scaring off predators by hijacking the  expired bodies of animals larger than  they are necromancer bees reanimate  animals using rather complicated spells  for such tiny insects moving in  different formations called dances to  get the muscles of their hives working  once more strange as this might sound  ordinary bees can actually perform  complicated dances to communicate the  direction and distance of flowers to  their fellow hive members  deeper within the nation of beasts is a  bleak landscape dominated by cubes of  rock that look like they fell from the  skies  known as the hades badlands the region  is a land of oblivion where reality  unravels due to the cube's strange  properties those who pass through may  lose their memory their minds or their  physical form  even deeper within the beast nation the  secretive ravenfolk keep watch over the  ghost forest while they interact and  trade with the other nations they do not  permit anyone to enter their mysterious  domain  for while the ghost forest might appear  like an ordinary grove the fog works as  a pocket dimension which some plants and  animals have evolved to phase in and out  of  one such plant is the starberry which  produces an enticing fruit it wants to  be eaten but not by ghost animals since  they can phase out the seeds during  digestion to prevent this the fruit  possesses a cage of thorns that stings  only ghosts with mortals able to pass  through it unharmed eating a starberry  means putting the bramble into your  mouth which can be unsettling even if  you know it won't sting  the haunting ghost lilies are perhaps  the most important plants of the ghost  forest these mind-altering flowers  invoke memories in a sense of nostalgia  when smelled or ingested this property  has made the lilies a luxury good and a  common export to more distant parts of  the realm  in the margins of the codex and versus  world one of the rarer and more  destructive creatures are the evoker  dragonflies these insects are  carnivorous and they hunt like  sharpshooters waiting for their prey and  then striking from afar with impressive  spells summoned from their tails to  resist the recoil of the bolt evoker  dragonflies must use their claws to grab  on to whatever they are standing on  the kickback of their dart is also used  proactively as propulsion by the  dragonflies with the insects shooting a  bolt in the opposite direction they are  headed propelling them at high speeds  towards their destination  and destructive magic isn't limited to  insects ancient scriptures say that  beings known as the fairies once  wandered the world spreading ruin for no  reason other than their own amusement  the even grimmer counterparts of the  fairies the nightmares also tormented  the land and drew the ire of the angelic  unison  the angelic beings used the last spark  of their divinity to banish them to the  two moons that orbit the planet since  other dimensions no longer existed after  the collapse the nightmares were sent to  the onyx moon where scripture says they  remain to this day ravenous and waiting  for a chance to take their revenge  the fairies were banished to the jade  moon and faded into myth over the  passing centuries yet recently sightings  of eerie creatures wearing domes of jade  on their heads have begun and strange  lights appear in the sky when the moons  are full  across the world of codex and versus  perhaps no location is as fabled or as  feared as the elsewhere woods a piece of  crumpled space where reality folds like  paper the elsewhere woods are a place  where lost things go some say towers of  slithering flesh with geometric summits  rise among the trees their origin and  function unknown others claim the woods  are made of many different trees from  all over the world with patches of pine  forest and stripes of tropical jungles  and brambles from arid lands fading into  wet fields of reeds floating among these  branches are white cloud possums  inquisitive marsupials that hover as if  they weigh nothing at all some reports  claim fearsome al griffins prowl the  elsewhere woods defending their  territory with fierce attentiveness what  truth there is in such fables is  difficult to say for few return from the  elsewhere woods with their lives  one of the few well-documented beings of  the elsewhere woods is the illusionist  butterfly also spotted in other parts of  the world these insects have an  impressive form of camouflage from their  caterpillar stage illusionist  butterflies are able to change color to  match their surrounding environment with  uncanny precision following  metamorphosis however they hide in a  different way the venations on their  wings form a pattern capable of casting  an illusion spell  many real butterflies have spots on  their wings that essentially serve the  same purpose mimicking the eyes of  predators to scare off would-be  attackers yet the illusionist butterfly  takes this a step further with their  patterns capable of creating an illusory  owl that moves and flies next to its  creator these owl projections are rarely  complete with their bodies appearing and  disappearing in a waving shape still  it's an incredible form of camouflage  that shows when in the elsewhere woods  things are seldom what they appear  entering the elsewhere woods is no easy  task for the region cannot be accessed  through mortal means there are rumors  that the skulls of cyclopses giant  beings who went extinct long ago  act as natural portals into the  elsewhere woods  monsters of unknown origin stalk the  caverns where these skulls can be found  chimeras made from many different beings  reports describe creatures with tentacle  arms necks which split into fanged  mouths and disturbing heads shaped like  crying children yet where could such  nightmares have come from  some have theorized that the cyclops  skulls connect to other places with  spatial anomalies there are rumors of a  land beyond the ocean far from any known  land mass lit by a fracture in space  known as the second horizon no one from  the known world has reached the shores  of this land although many have tried  according to legend the land is  populated with three-eyed people a  lineage different from any other their  land is also populated with hammer goals  seagulls with the heads of hammerhead  sharks what truth is there to such  strange tales no one can say for certain  for in the margins of codex and versus  there will always be things which evade  all understanding  observing the world of codex and versus  is like looking through a fractured  window with the images shifting and  merging before your eyes yet this  scrambled world of fables and myth  follows its own kind of rules if one  looks closely enough there are countless  other strange and wondrous aspects of  codex and vs i wasn't able to cover here  and you can see more of the art and read  more of the narrative using the links in  the description and if you find this  world as interesting as i do i encourage  you to follow and support luca vanzella  who is continuing to flesh out this  dreamlike realm once again links are  down below  and as always thanks for watching  if you enjoyed this entry please lend  your support by liking subscribing and  hitting the notification icon to stay up  to date on all things curious see you in  the next video  you

